  "details": "Bone positions are not really synced when well you're in fbt. I'm guessing this is caused by whatever adjustments they're being made to fbt in this new patch are not networked at all\nHow to replicate:\n-Be with someone else in any world, both in fbt\n-Have any of you shake their hip tracker. Locally you'll notice how your head stays in place but for the other person they'll see your head moving up and down like with the old fbt ik. Or simply try to touch each other's fingers and you'll notice how even if they say they are touching your fingertip for you it looks off. Here's a video demonstration I did https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nFefweP0XD0&feature=youtu.be",
